					<h2 class="title h2"> 
						WALT DISNEY WORLD® Resort 
					</h2>
				
			
			
				<p class="description">
					If theme parks are the first thing that comes to mind when you think of WALT DISNEY WORLD® Resort, you are in good company. But between water parks, world-class resorts, and the dining, entertainment and shopping paradise that is DISNEY SPRINGS®, theme parks only tell half of the WALT DISNEY WORLD story.
				</p>
			
			
				




	
		<a 
