</div><div data-civid="6a677ffbbd1642c28eabbca7" class="contentRender contentRender_23 contentRender_type_widget contentRender_name_plugins_collections_type_custom_faq_question contentRender_name_plugins_collections_template_custom_faqs" data-sv-time="338" data-sv-index="23" data-gtm-vars='{ "tCore" : { "contentNum" : "1" } }'>









<section 
	class="core-faqs expandable core-styles"
	data-guid="4bb62d57-9dcc-4758-8f8d-735734ef0d0b"
	data-js="plugins_collections_custom_faqs"
	style="opacity: 0;"
>
	
		
			<h2 class="faq-title">Orlando Theme Park FAQs</h2>
		
		
	
	
	<div class="faqs-container" data-accordion>
		
		
		
			<div class="single-col">
				
					
	
	<li id="67c741ccea803baaff0e8480_1" class="accordion-item faq-item" data-accordion-item data-sem-label="How many theme parks are there in Orlando?">
		<button class="accordion-title question" data-accordion-title data-sem-faq="toggle" data-sem-text="How many theme parks are there in Orlando?">
			<p>How many theme parks are there in Orlando?</p>
		</button>

		<div class="accordion-content answer" data-tab-content aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="inner">
				<p>No destination on Earth has more &mdash; or more iconic &mdash; theme parks than Orlando. We&nbsp;have 10 theme parks, a water theme park and multiple water parks.</p>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</li>

				
					
	
	<li id="67c741f1ea803baaff0e84a6_2" class="accordion-item faq-item" data-accordion-item data-sem-label="How many theme parks are at WALT DISNEY WORLD&reg; Resort?">
		<button class="accordion-title question" data-accordion-title data-sem-faq="toggle" data-sem-text="How many theme parks are at WALT DISNEY WORLD&reg; Resort?">
			<p>How many theme parks are at WALT DISNEY WORLD&reg; Resort?</p>
		</button>

		<div class="accordion-content answer" data-tab-content aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="inner">
				<p>WALT DISNEY WORLD has four theme parks, including <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bcd6de633c98264e07" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/magic-kingdom/" target="_self">MAGIC KINGDOM&#xAE; Park</a>, <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bcd6de633c98264e31" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/epcot/" target="_self">EPCOT</a>&#xAE;, <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bcd6de633c98264e85" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/hollywood-studios/" target="_self">DISNEY&#x2019;S HOLLYWOOD STUDIOS</a>&#xAE; and <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bcd6de633c98264e5b" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/animal-kingdom/" target="_self">DISNEY&#x2019;S ANIMAL KINGDOM&#xAE; Theme Park</a>. They also have two water parks: <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bdd6de633c98264f03" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/blizzard-beach/" target="_self">DISNEY&#x2019;S BLIZZARD BEACH Water Park</a>&#xA0;and <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bdd6de633c98264ed9" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/typhoon-lagoon/" target="_self">DISNEY&#x2019;S TYPHOON LAGOON&#xA0;Water Park</a>.&#xA0;&#xA0;With so many imaginative options to choose from, as well as dining,&#xA0;shopping and fun at <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bdd6de633c98264eaf" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/walt-disney-world-resort/disney-springs/" target="_self">DISNEY SPRINGS</a>&#xAE;, and <a data-sv-linklookup-id="6660affe3a980d7108598f6c" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/places-to-stay/hotels-resorts/disney-all-listings/" target="_self">more than two dozen official hotel properties&#xA0;and other accommodations</a>, you will never run out of unforgettable, memory-making&#xA0;adventures at WALT DISNEY WORLD. (<a data-sv-linklookup-id="68d69d01d74fe0173480f335" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_assets_link" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://disneyworld.disney.go.com/experience-updates/park-reservations/" target="_blank">Reservations may be required at the time of your visit</a>.)</p>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</li>

				
					
	
	<li id="67c74224ea803baaff0e84cd_3" class="accordion-item faq-item" data-accordion-item data-sem-label="How many theme parks are at Universal Orlando Resort?">
		<button class="accordion-title question" data-accordion-title data-sem-faq="toggle" data-sem-text="How many theme parks are at Universal Orlando Resort?">
			<p>How many theme parks are at Universal Orlando Resort?</p>
		</button>

		<div class="accordion-content answer" data-tab-content aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="inner">
				<p>Universal Orlando has four parks, including a water theme park. They include <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bdd6de633c98264f2d" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/universal-orlando-resort/universal-studios-florida/" target="_self">Universal&#xA0;Studios Florida</a>, <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bdd6de633c98264f57" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/universal-orlando-resort/islands-of-adventure/" target="_self">Universal Islands of Adventure</a>, <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c98264fd5" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/universal-orlando-resort/volcano-bay/" target="_self">Universal Volcano Bay</a> and the all-new&#xA0;<a data-sv-linklookup-id="673b748adc3ca87cf62af1c3" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/universal-orlando-resort/epic-universe/" target="_self">Universal Epic Universe</a>. You can also opt for dinner, entertainment, shopping and more at <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c98264fab" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/universal-orlando-resort/citywalk/" target="_self">Universal CityWalk</a>, located at the nexus of Universal Orlando, or an amazing stay at one&#xA0;of <a data-sv-linklookup-id="663e53d42f865a56189e51a5" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/places-to-stay/hotels-resorts/universal-all-listings/" target="_self">Universal Orlando&#x2019;s official hotel properties and other nearby accommodations</a>.&#xA0;</p>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</li>

				
					
	
	<li id="67c742c5ea803baaff0e8528_4" class="accordion-item faq-item" data-accordion-item data-sem-label="How many theme parks are at SeaWorld&reg; Orlando?">
		<button class="accordion-title question" data-accordion-title data-sem-faq="toggle" data-sem-text="How many theme parks are at SeaWorld&reg; Orlando?">
			<p>How many theme parks are at SeaWorld&reg; Orlando?</p>
		</button>

		<div class="accordion-content answer" data-tab-content aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="inner">
				<p>For up-close animal encounters and pulse-pounding rides, <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c98264fff" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/seaworld-orlando/seaworld/" target="_self">SeaWorld&#x2019;s main Orlando&#xA0;theme park</a> has you covered. You can also take advantage of sandy beaches and thrilling&#xA0;rides at <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c98265029" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/seaworld-orlando/aquatica/" target="_self">Aquatica&#xAE; Orlando</a>, or enjoy serene relaxation, awe-inspiring animal encounters&#xA0;and perfect pampering at <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c98265053" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/seaworld-orlando/discovery-cove/" target="_self">Discovery Cove</a>&#xAE; (<a data-sv-linklookup-id="5feb6ca1c5cc9c2d4a4e1097" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_assets_link" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://discoverycove.com/orlando/pricing/" target="_blank">reservations required</a>). SeaWorld is also an&#xA0;official partner of <a data-sv-linklookup-id="68dfed00a4b60394eedd3c37" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_assets_link" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/places-to-stay/hotels-resorts/?bounds=false&amp;filter_regions%5B0%5D=173&amp;sort=qualityScore&amp;view=grid" target="_self">several nearby hotels</a>, which provide guests with special park benefits.</p>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</li>

				
					
	
	<li id="67c74339ea803baaff0e8559_5" class="accordion-item faq-item" data-accordion-item data-sem-label="How many theme parks are at LEGOLAND&reg; Florida Resort?">
		<button class="accordion-title question" data-accordion-title data-sem-faq="toggle" data-sem-text="How many theme parks are at LEGOLAND&reg; Florida Resort?">
			<p>How many theme parks are at LEGOLAND&reg; Florida Resort?</p>
		</button>

		<div class="accordion-content answer" data-tab-content aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="inner">
				<p>Children and their families can have a blast with kids-focused rides and plenty of building opportunities at LEGOLAND Florida Resort. In addition to <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c9826507d" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/legoland-florida-resort/legoland-florida-theme-park/" target="_self">LEGOLAND&#xAE; Florida Theme Park</a> and its onsite <a data-sv-linklookup-id="51906" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_listings_listing" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/listing/legoland%c2%ae-water-park/51906/" target="_self">LEGOLAND&#xAE; Florida Water Park</a>, LEGOLAND Florida operates <a data-sv-linklookup-id="658361bed6de633c982650a7" data-sv-linklookup-type="plugins_nav_navitem_primary_main" data-sv-targetauto="true" href="https://www.visitorlando.com/things-to-do/theme-parks/legoland-florida-resort/peppa-pig-theme-park/" target="_self">Peppa Pig Theme Park Florida</a> and SEA LIFE Florida Aquarium.</p>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</li>

				
			</div>
		
	</div>
</section>

